# Preserve-session plugin artifacts (must not be shared — cause registry collisions)
**/.claude/hash.txt
**/.claude/settings.local.json

# Local-only development docs (compass/ under any plugin)
**/compass/

# Build artifacts
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.next/
**/.cache/

# Local-only dev files (not published to marketplace)
**/CLAUDE.md
**/INTEGRATION_NOTES.md
/scripts/

# macOS noise
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# Local demo media (uploaded to GitHub user-attachments instead)
**/demo.mov
**/demo.mp4

# sync-to-fork local meta
**/.syncignore

# Personal dev workflow (upstream-watch integration) — not part of plugin distribution
**/.claude/hooks/upstream-check.sh
**/.claude/settings.json
